  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0c51423038c2f06e59b76e66",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我急忙追了出去。但是，人类要如何追上狂奔的马娘呢？\r\n只一眨眼，她已经跑得无影无踪。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b0df761d602d425525ae3d78904c05e962abe1327815185de7f1808de471ef8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1047/storytimeline_041047003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        19,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/19/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81649b27b858ba579c5f049e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我告诉她，昨天那位教官告诉了我她要参赛的消息。\r\n听了我的解释，满脸不可思议的她这才明白怎么回事。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c4c81fba2c7f49b227b3ba5dfbd353ccdcb27f93c56da5523faf518eb893a4d8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1047/storytimeline_041047003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ba6254e1d242c37dfdf080f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我略一思考便得出答案。\r\n虽说不上原因——但我可以确定，她一定在那儿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "db09fdcfa2c5792d7383fa5d5bd6feb40ab5cedf6f285a36f725340a393decd2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1047/storytimeline_041047003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        20,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/20/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:389cba4dd68b62dc1fc9b13f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "罗布罗伊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7a39356809f722bdee6aa1eda37707626ff2c059d8d802f9a1b266777092152",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1047/storytimeline_041047003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        21,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/21/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:48c15f62e036c890a28d4652",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练赛道——不出所料，她果然在这里。\r\n她独自站在场边，出神地注视着训练中的赛马娘们。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1fe762031da3c7a2a1b176453dec39fe9b475d132d95cff8423d36efce1b5b9b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1047/storytimeline_041047003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        21,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/21/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1fd36dc6261947364d88c208",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我就觉得你不会真的回去。",
      "source_fingerprint": "689c0f8aa3112c8d3fef51e19b0e188a6fa02e51fc6908e2759d20e5e2d36cc3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1047/storytimeline_041047003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        22,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/22/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4fc7d4d04d6a9a460bb0b673",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "荒漠英雄",
      "source_fingerprint": "aaf6b29d17c0d17b31649773a41c9995f963b5bb8c45fb8d89c79c740e5bc158",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1047/storytimeline_041047003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        22,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/22/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b560505283267e62f07e6a8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "诶……咦？训练员？！\r\n您为什么……？！",
      "source_fingerprint": "097e67253652ba1357049e2e2978d6afbc234433012504eab14dc202bf4f3d00",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1047/storytimeline_041047003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        22,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/22/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eec2947f5cdcec9de72cc654",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "毕竟……罗布罗伊，你很不擅长『放弃』吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e33f0c46e1514736bbdd55faeb45a67a6b68f27c1704626cf6bbaf94d0e568b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1047/storytimeline_041047003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
