    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:660e723971fe771017b90a2a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我、我觉得那种情况下，\r\n大多数人会认为我是真回去了才对……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4dea8d444e86baf889c4a7a4bd47d57694da2786060d42d49dcbeccc3853c670",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1047/storytimeline_041047003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        23,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/23/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c3fb29033415c0411428b22",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我取出昨天捡到的笔记本。笔记本上记载的，正是她同困境不断抗争的轨迹。\r\n——这就是她不擅『放弃』的证据。",
      "source_fingerprint": "384a26c8f744eec33dcf00eddb2c795aa9087a8c0aa6fbff31ff7a02e7153353",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1047/storytimeline_041047003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        24,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/24/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af6320294602e66758dc72ff",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "啊……不好意思，我想看看谁是失主……",
      "source_fingerprint": "b7c1e3679275d90993a902142ab2a7b52489fcca6716c8b4460d869a3c9aab39",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1047/storytimeline_041047003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        25,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/25/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d75e879b35389d5091b628de",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "荒漠英雄",
      "source_fingerprint": "aaf6b29d17c0d17b31649773a41c9995f963b5bb8c45fb8d89c79c740e5bc158",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
