    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b4109f15af09aa841dd48d4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "啊，那是……\r\n难、难道您已经看过了吗……？！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4aa6bc80393d609cc480184bda13d5d0e048d36ac4362da53755b65ee9190429",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
