    {
      "uid": "zhcn:69b2b1bd0747256f265e6593",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "啊……啊哈哈……您一定觉得这很蠢吧。\r\n摆着一副已经放弃了的样子，\r\n却在笔记本上还不停地记载这些东西……",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d605dbc75feaf01a927b4e3bc7cf546526ab523ccdd2510988c2e0d6a46dbbe",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1047/storytimeline_041047003.json",
      "json_path": [
