      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "反正……我也做不到……\r\n抱歉，让您看见了些奇怪的东西。\r\n这个笔记本，您扔掉就好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "492d74f87bee0499f584fb05c10418e8411b9096e56a0893fac260fee40a1af4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
